1
00:00:00,958 --> 00:00:02,583
You freaking bench!

2
00:00:02,666 --> 00:00:04,458
How dare you hit me?

3
00:00:04,458 --> 00:00:05,958
What are you waiting for?

4
00:00:05,958 --> 00:00:06,625
Cut her down!

5
00:00:12,791 --> 00:00:13,791
Get lost.

6
00:00:14,541 --> 00:00:18,208
Bench, I work for Lord
Darren of Black Raven City!

7
00:00:18,208 --> 00:00:20,791
Touch me and he'll
make you disappear from Golantis!

8
00:00:20,791 --> 00:00:22,541
I'll kill you first.

9
00:00:22,791 --> 00:00:24,000
Wait.

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,041
Lord Severin.

11
00:00:27,041 --> 00:00:30,041
Since he's Darren’s dog, let Darren deal with him.

12
00:00:30,375 --> 00:00:32,416
If he can't control his own mutt,

13
00:00:32,416 --> 00:00:34,250
I'll handle both of them.

14
00:00:34,375 --> 00:00:35,833
Enough, Severin!

15
00:00:35,833 --> 00:00:38,416
I know being
dumped hurts your pride,

16
00:00:38,416 --> 00:00:39,791
but face reality and stop making

17
00:00:39,791 --> 00:00:41,291
completely different worlds now.

18
00:00:42,041 --> 00:00:44,041
Me making a scene?

19
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:47,250
You're the one
who broke the engagement.

20
00:00:47,250 --> 00:00:49,291
I'm just teaching
you all some manners.

21
00:00:49,291 --> 00:00:51,125
You brought these filthy,

22
00:00:51,125 --> 00:00:53,541
stinking miners into the Holy Cathedral

23
00:00:53,541 --> 00:00:55,125
That's not causing trouble?

24
00:00:55,125 --> 00:00:56,791
Of course it’s wrong!

25
00:00:56,791 --> 00:00:58,750
They don't belong in
a place like this!

26
00:00:59,291 --> 00:01:00,500
Livia.

27
00:01:00,958 --> 00:01:03,791
Looking at you now… I
actually feel sorry for you.

28
00:01:03,791 --> 00:01:05,291
You feel sorry for me?

29
00:01:05,291 --> 00:01:08,500
I raised my family to
the top in just three years,

30
00:01:09,125 --> 00:01:12,125
and you, a pathetic miner, what gives you the right?

31
00:01:12,125 --> 00:01:14,791
Without Lord Severin secretly supporting you,

32
00:01:14,791 --> 00:01:17,291
your family would
have collapsed long ago.

33
00:01:17,791 --> 00:01:18,875
He helped me?

34
00:01:18,875 --> 00:01:20,375
How else do
you think a declining

35
00:01:20,375 --> 00:01:21,791
family like yours reached this height?

36
00:01:21,791 --> 00:01:23,083
You're both insane.

37
00:01:23,083 --> 00:01:24,291
This is disgusting!

38
00:01:24,291 --> 00:01:27,791
Lord Darren of Black Raven City has arrived!

39
00:01:32,125 --> 00:01:36,291
You’re finished, you little shit!
